.TH KUMBAR 1 "2026" "kumde 0.8.0" "KumDE Manual"
.SH NAME
kumbar \- status bar for KumDE
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kumbar
.SH DESCRIPTION
kumbar is a layer-shell status bar that attaches to a running kumde
compositor. It shows per-output workspace indicators (clickable \-\-
left-click a workspace number to switch to it), the focused window's
title, and a clock. Workspace and title updates arrive in real time
over kumde's IPC socket; kumbar reconnects automatically if kumde
restarts or the socket is briefly unavailable.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B KUMDE_IPC
Path to the kumde IPC socket. Set automatically by kumde; required for
workspace/title updates and click-to-switch.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kumde (1),
.BR kumde-msg (1)
